rs.1","local_name":"sase-rs.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-rs","agent_clan_generation":"20260821101603","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-rs.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-rs[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Durable feature-flag controls in the SASE Admin Center[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Users can inspect and persistently enable or disable every [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]registered SASE feature flag from either a polished Config > Flags [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]pane or the sase flag CLI, with both surfaces sharing one [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]crash-safe state mutation path and applying changes through the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]established ACE and AXE restart flows without editing normal [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]configuration files.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]feature_flag_control_center.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust feature-flag preference store and bindings[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: add a versioned, locked, atomic machine-state store for persistent[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]feature-flag booleans in sase-core, expose strict PyO3 read and set [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bindings, and prove concurrency, corruption, downgrade, and durability [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]behavior.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Adopt the released core binding floor[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]floor[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]floor: wait for the core release, raise sase's sase-core-rs dependency [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]floor, refresh the lockfile and editable install, and smoke-test the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]published bindings before Python callers land.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared Python resolution and mutation facade[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]runtime[dim] · [dim][/dim]after floor[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]runtime: add the thin typed Python adapter, insert saved machine [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]preferences into feature-flag resolution at the designed precedence, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]synchronize process transport after writes, and return one structured [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]mutation outcome used by every frontend.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Persistent flag enable and disable commands[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after runtime[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: add sorted sase flag disable and enable commands with rich and JSON[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]results, completion, idempotent shared mutations, and the existing AXE [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]restart machinery, including clear partial-success reporting.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Beautiful Config Flags pane and controlled restart flow[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tui[dim] · [dim][/dim]after runtime[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tui: create the default-on sunset rollout flag and its live call site, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add the lazy Config > Flags list/detail pane with filtering, provenance,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]removal metadata, confirmation and narrow layouts, and apply successful [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]toggles through the existing proc-aware ACE plus AXE restart path.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Integrated documentation, visual coverage, and release [/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]verification[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli, tui[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]polish: align all user documentation and help, exercise the complete CLI[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and TUI journeys including both rollout-flag states and restart [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]failures, refresh intentional PNG goldens, and run the repository's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exhaustive landing gates.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-rs","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-rs.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-03414b97086824376ea5fc91bab93b9c","started_at":"2026-08-21T14:16:25.496072+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"27c30cf26ecc376f1dd28be83c00fb4d52fa2c6a516f88725021f0560b6b7bf8","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-rs.3/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"32e5e608c77d865e7792bf405e87cc79c6af548d053f9df466da4a4fae6169a9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-rs.3/meta.json","size_bytes":633},"prompt":{"digest":"d829ec3d237f90edf527658d2284464db2d73688e13db1cdf22f97c7fc5ab177","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-rs.3/prompt.md","size_bytes":141},"state":{"digest":"bfeb969cb02df0db170f4dea402af9c6d9df7ed515ffcea60fe8da7fe3814f93","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-rs.3/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-rs.3","local_name":"sase-rs.3","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-rs","agent_clan_generation":"20260821101603","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-rs.3","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tri